// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3334071136" "The first cut stings, but not for long."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P670487485" "Well I'm afraid I can't let you in here, friend."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1142410317" "Some nerve you have, trying to get past me.  Not very bright, but definitely nervy."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P191231569" "Oh we're fine here.  Just waiting for some fun to show up."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1486067078" "Well, sure.  I am a work for hire.  I understand that.  We all do.  But standing in a big group shoulder-to-shoulder doesn't exactly scream 'stealth'."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1446499764" "It's your money.  If you order us to stand here like a big fat target, we will.  But you can appreciate that I'm not completely on board with this.  Our talents could be used better in a more stealthy fashion."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1579869299" "Can't talk.  My break is over."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1526189486" "Bye now!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1589433147" "Work is creeping in on this conversation.  Over."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3231662536" "We're well paid.  However they want to use us, is not our call."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4213671820" "Don't worry, we'll do some recon once it gets dark."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4141687727" "This whole situation is strange.  But we're not here to make judgment calls.  We're here because we're paid to be."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2724490256" "We'll meet at the usual spot tonight.  You know where."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1900288757" "Time to earn our pay!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4251016030" "Break time's over!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2350923917" "I'll take down the first two targets.  You get the other two.  You know which ones, right?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3190102039" "No, that's not how it's going to be.  I told you.  We can only make ourselves visible for so long.  We need to go underground."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2158596735" "Of course there's more to it than that.  We just need to make this work to our advantage."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1392955651" "You didn't hear a thing."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4262112400" "I'll take care of this."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2435042377" "Let me take care of this intrusion.  It would be my pleasure."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SNIPERLOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1669513616" "Going somewhere?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SNIPERLOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1028140529" "Hello, stranger."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SNIPERLOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4199207383" "Target locked."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TECHNICIAN_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P319687631" "Hmmm..."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TECHNICIAN_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2493485294" "Doesn't seem quite right."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TECHNICIAN_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2710303511" "That's not an expected result."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TECHNICIAN_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3404435140" "You!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TECHNICIAN_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2557609430" "How did you get in here?!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_TECHNICIAN_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3547245850" "Out!!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_NIGHTPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2666518334" "Duty calls!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_NIGHTPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1756334441" "Oh good.  I was starting to think this shift would be boring!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_NIGHTPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2042867140" "Yoo hoo!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P933184048" "Not your day, is it?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3492962015" "Tsk tsk.  You made a wrong turn, friend."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALLLEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P958175825" "Cold steel and warm flesh.  Is there ever a better combination?"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALLPEEK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1544565371" "There you are."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALLPEEK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P92470900" "Change in plans."

